  - "Forex"
  - "financial time series"
  - "Double Top"
  - "Double Bottom"
  - "Head and Shoulders"
  - "Inverse Head and Shoulders"
abstract: >
  A curated image dataset for financial chart-pattern recognition containing
  1,200 224x224 candlestick chart images across four pattern classes:
  Double Top, Double Bottom, Head and Shoulders, and Inverse Head and Shoulders.
  The dataset was constructed from publicly available Forex time-series data
  using rule-based detection algorithms followed by manual verification and curation.
